<title>GERMANY: Bilfinger 5-mo building output up 13.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Bilfinger 5-mo building output up 13.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five months to May 31</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group construction output	     3,783   up 13.9 pct</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		    10,118  up 3.2 pct</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		   3,922   up 2.1 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German building group is Bilfinger + Berger AG.</p>
</text>
